## North-star outcomes

- [ ] Agent finds the **right symbols/files** in 10k–50k-file repos without drowning in noise
- [ ] IDE + agent share the **same language truth** (defs / refs / diagnostics / rename)
- [ ] Multi-task work can run **in parallel locally** (worktrees + delegates) safely
- [ ] PR → CI → Fix loop is a **normal product path**, not a manual side quest
- [ ] Long sessions stay sharp via **compacted memory** + bounded context
- [ ] Daily micro-edits are fast (**Inline Edit**) without opening a full agent turn every time

