## Next up (priority order — Plan Mode first)

> **عربي:** قسم — 1) Plan Mode (Cursor-class plan → approve → execute) — CRITICAL

### 1) Plan Mode (Cursor-class plan → approve → execute) — CRITICAL
**Why:** Biggest product gap vs Cursor for serious work. Today we only have mid-turn `manage_plan`, not a draft/approve/execute workflow.  
**Also:** Required foundation for the Unified Cloud Bridge handoff (“approve plan on web → execute on desktop”).  
**Full focused spec:** `.cursor/rules/01-وضع-التخطيط-Plan-Mode.mdc` (always read/update that file for Plan Mode details).

High-level checklist (details + Cursor improvements live in the spec):
- [ ] Plan mode vs Agent mode in UI + write-gate before Execute
- [ ] Structured Plan artifact (persist, edit, reorder, approve)
- [ ] Execute walks approved steps with live statuses; pause/resume/fail recovery
- [ ] Anti-drift + acceptance checks; index-grounded step hints
- [ ] Beat Cursor: true editability, persistence, citations, parallel/ops-aware steps
- [ ] Tests: persistence, write-gate, status transitions

**Exit criteria:** See §8 Acceptance criteria in `01-وضع-التخطيط-Plan-Mode.mdc`.

> **عربي:** قسم — 2) Unified Cloud Bridge (web Admin/User + Firestore-first continuum) — CRITICAL DIFFERENTIATOR

### 2) Unified Cloud Bridge (web Admin/User + Firestore-first continuum) — CRITICAL DIFFERENTIATOR
**Why:** Discuss on phone/web → same history & Plan → desktop Execute without re-briefing. Cursor is weak here; Vigil can own this.  
**Data principle:** **Firestore is the base / SoR (cloud online).** Local VigilDB sync is **optional cache only** — not the product foundation.  
**Phase 1 status:** **Not built in VigilAIAgent yet.**  
**Full focused specs:**  
- Continuum / desktop side: `.cursor/rules/02-جسر-السحابة-الموحد.mdc`  
- **Separate Vigil Web repo contract (portable):** `.cursor/rules/03-عقد-مشروع-الويب.mdc` — copy into the web project when that work starts

High-level checklist:
- [ ] Firebase Auth shared (web + desktop); Firestore-first chats/plans/usage
- [ ] Admin dashboard: customers, packages, subscriptions, wallets, usage
- [ ] User web ChatGPT-like shell: sidebar (New Chat, Search, Recents, Projects, Library, Plans, Schedule, Usage, …)
- [ ] Desktop **hosts/embeds** same Vigil Web (carbon-copy history UX) + local Execute
- [ ] Optional local cache (default not required for happy path)
- [ ] Unified multi-model metering on one subscription
- [ ] Never upload project source files to Firestore
- [ ] Tests/rules for SoR + embed + no-code-upload guardrail

**Exit criteria:** See §10 in `02-جسر-السحابة-الموحد.mdc` + §9 in `03-عقد-مشروع-الويب.mdc`.  
**Depends on:** Plan Mode artifact shape stable enough to sync (#1).

> **عربي:** قسم — 2b) Support / DB Copilot (SQL Server + PostgreSQL) — DIFFERENTIATOR FOR NON-DEV ROLES

