### 2e) Vigil Secure (defensive web security assistant) — SELLABLE DIFFERENTIATOR
**Why:** Developers without InfoSec still ship web apps; Secure = find/fix on **owned** targets via Vigil Browser + agent patch loop; optional paid Secure Report for companies.  
**Full focused spec:** `.cursor/rules/06-الأمان-الدفاعي-للويب.mdc`  
**Opinion:** Worth it as **add-on/SKU inside Vigil**, not a random hacker toolkit; never unauthorized third-party hacking.

High-level checklist:
- [ ] Allowlist / ownership gates (sidecar-enforced)
- [ ] Passive pack (headers, cookies, deps, secrets) + AR/EN education
- [ ] Active pack on authorized preview + Browser evidence
- [ ] Fix → retest loop; Plan Mode security plans
